  "holistic_F_H": 2,
  "section_notes": "S1 is strict (24h all-incident reporting, 72h customer notice). S2 requires 55°C testing and customer access to exact failure rates, but >5% only triggers review/corrective action without sales stop. S3 delays new-unit shut-off to 24 months and retrofit to 72 months, S4 requires built-in suppression at 36 months, and S5 makes 8/100k a validation/investigation trigger with recall only if the regulator finds it necessary."
